'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Astor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/530747a9-3ad3-574d-b31c-3d05c0475ee8', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/530747a9-3ad3-574d-b31c-3d05c0475ee8'}, {'abstract': 'The Boston executive Dombrowski has won just one World Series in his 40-year career, with the Marlins. But that’s never stopped him from pursuing more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/08/31/sports/dave-dombrowski-ever-the-tinkerer-readies-the-red-sox-for-october.html', 'snippet': 'The Boston executive Dombrowski has won just one World Series in his 40-year career, with the Marlins. But that’s never stopped him from pursuing more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The doors are now locked to all newcomers hoping to play past Oct. 1. Once September arrives, baseball executives cannot add pieces to help in the postseason. Everyone eligible for a playoff roster must be in his organization before Sept. 1. The gang’s all there now, for some lucky franchise. We just don’t know which.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/01/sports/01KEPNER1/01KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/01/sports/01KEPNER1/01KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/01/sports/01KEPNER1/01KEPNER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/01/sports/01KEPNER1/01KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'he