bunted on Boston’s second at-bat of the night Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/01/sports/baseball/cc-sabathia-eduardo-nunez-bunt.html', 'snippet': '“I just feel like they try to take the weak road,” Sabathia, the Yankees’ starter, said after Eduardo Nunez bunted on Boston’s second at-bat of the night Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a delicately hit ball, a bunt placed by Eduardo Nunez just in front of the pitcher’s mound in the first inning on Thursday. But for C.\u2009C. Sabathia, who came down off the hill to field it, the bunt came saddled with a gesture, one that seemed bold enough to awaken a bear in winter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/02sabathia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/02sabathia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/02sabathia-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/merlin-to-scoop-126654782-646502-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/merlin-to-scoop-126654782-646502-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 462}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/02/multimedia/02sabathia/merlin-to-scoop-126654782-646502-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_nam