tist and a lawyer living in SoHo, Mr. Posen first draped fabric on dolls as a toddler. As a teen at Saint Ann’s School in Brooklyn, he turned the actresses Paz de la Huerta, Jemima Kirke and Lola Schnabel into muses. While a student at Central St. Martin’s in London, he designed a pink silk dress for Naomi Campbell that was passed from woman to woman before catching the eye of a reporter for The New York Times. Buyers came calling and Mr. Posen set up a studio with the help of his mother and sister. A star was born. He was 20.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 308, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 308}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 526, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE2/03GUIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 984, 'widt