tte-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Since 2013, this wide-ranging exploration of contemporary vocal music has had the intimate feel of witnessing works in progress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The art making feels unusually personal during the Resonant Bodies Festival, which began in 2013 and has swiftly become something to look forward to each year. A wide-ranging exploration of contemporary vocal music, lately hosted at Roulette in Brooklyn, it follows a simple formula: Three nights (Tuesday through Thursday, Sept. 5-7), three singers per night, one 45-minute set per singer. The vocalists are the curators.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/arts/03GUIDE1/03GUIDE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images