 Alibi.’” But she wanted to get back into solo writing after a career in Hollywood, and detective fiction called. The risk paid off: The Alphabet books, which star the Southern California-based private investigator Kinsey Millhone, have been steadily enthralling readers with heists, betrayals and murders for the last 35 years.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 603}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 796, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/10INSIDETHELIST/10INSIDETHELIST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 796, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'su