407784'}, {'abstract': 'Rather than planning for economic changes we imagine, it is better to prepare for change itself with smarter social, educational and employment policies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/02/business/economy/get-ready-for-technological-upheaval-by-expecting-the-unimagined.html', 'snippet': 'Rather than planning for economic changes we imagine, it is better to prepare for change itself with smarter social, educational and employment policies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Self-driving vehicles could upend the transportation sector and eliminate a million or more jobs. Algorithms that decode M.R.I.s put a whole medical subfield at risk. And the list of professions and sectors soon to be obsolete grows steadily by the day.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 616, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 616}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/business/03VIEW/03VIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 997, 'subTy