brainer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/02/sports/tennis/fabio-fognini-us-open.html', 'snippet': 'It may take awhile for officials to decide the long-term fate of this foul-mouthed player. Based on his past behavior, though, it should be a no-brainer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the biggest victories at the United States Open on Saturday didn’t happen on a tennis court. It was even sweeter than a great sports performance, and much more satisfying, too.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03MACUR/03MACUR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1382, 'width': 1972, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Crude Rant Gets Fognini Booted From the Open — and Good Riddance', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Crude Rant Gets a Player the Boot — and Good Riddance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fognini, Fabio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nastase, Ilie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Tennis Federation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-02T23:49:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Macur', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macur', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa119c10-841f-5c5d-9707-e5f8433bb990', 'word_count': 763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa119c10-841f-5c5d-9707-e5f8433bb990'}, {'abstract': 'The latest Rockford Peaches are another tribute to the All-American Girls Professional Baseball League, which was also re-created on film 25 years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/02/sports/baseball/no-madonna-no-geena-davis-but-still-in-a-league-of-their-own.html', 'snippet': 'The latest Rockford Peaches are another tribute to the All-American Girls Professional Baseball League, which was also re-created on film 25 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOUTH ELGIN, Ill. — Strike one. “You swing like a girl!” the pitcher barked, heckling yet another player at the plate. Sonja Bushnick of the Rockford Peaches lifted her wooden bat again. She passed on one ball and fouled off another. On the next pitch she hit a short pop-up that th