: 'Hoskins, who hit 11 home runs in 18 games and rewrote major league history, has leaned on routine and preparation to allow his talent to shine through.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/02/sports/baseball/in-phillies-gloomy-season-rookie-rhys-hoskins-is-a-beacon.html', 'snippet': 'Hoskins, who hit 11 home runs in 18 games and rewrote major league history, has leaned on routine and preparation to allow his talent to shine through.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each day last weekend, Rhys Hoskins of the Philadelphia Phillies reached a home run total faster than any player ever had before. He hit his ninth homer that Friday in his 16th career game. He launched his 10th homer the next day, and his 11th the next. No other major leaguer had ever arrived at those mileposts in so few games.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03kepner-web4/03kepner-web4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03kepner-web4/03kepner-web4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03kepner-web4/03kepner-web4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03kepner-web4/merlin-to-scoop-126467420-210140-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/03/sports/03kepner-web4/merlin-to-scoop-126467420-210140-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'capti