7/09/05/sports/basketball/houston-rockets-sale-tilman-fertitta.html', 'snippet': 'The sale to Fertitta, who owns more than 500 restaurants as well as casinos and hotels, carries the highest price ever for an N.B.A. team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Houston Rockets will be sold for $2.2 billion, the highest price ever paid for an N.B.A. team, said a person with knowledge of the deal who spoke on the condition of anonymity because the sale was not yet completed. The team and the buyer, Tilman J. Fertitta, announced the sale on Tuesday, but did not disclose the price.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/06/sports/06rockets-web/06rockets-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': N