nt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When they want to move as a group, meerkats call to each other. Capuchin monkeys trill. Gorillas grunt. Honeybees make what is called a piping sound.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wild Dogs Sneeze When They Are Ready to Hunt', 'kicker': 'ScienceTake', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Analyzing Ah-Choos: All Dogs in Favor Of the Motion, Sneeze', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Botswana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proceedings of the Royal Society B (Journal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hunting and Trapping', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jordan, Neil R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Reena H', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-06T18:07:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Gorman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gorman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87dda8ac-9cab-5a00-9fca-d1dc4b10a0f8', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87dda8ac-9cab-5a00-9fca-d1dc4b10a0f8'}, {'abstract': 'Gauri Lankesh, an outspoken journalist, was assassinated Tuesday night. Friends said she had received too many threats to count, but laughed them off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/06/world/asia/gauri-lankesh-india-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Gauri Lankesh, an outspoken journalist, was assassinated Tuesday night. Friends said she had received too many threats to count, but laughed them off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Gauri Lankesh, one of India’s most outsp