0-5397-5425-af58-920167dd64fa', 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3823ef40-5397-5425-af58-920167dd64fa'}, {'abstract': 'The new documentary “The Challenge” observes the leisure pursuits of a group of rich young men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/07/movies/review-falcons-and-falconers-in-the-desert-of-qatar.html', 'snippet': 'The new documentary “The Challenge” observes the leisure pursuits of a group of rich young men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are images in “The Challenge,” a compact, intriguing documentary by Yuri Ancarani, that seem to belong less to a nonfiction film than to a hallucination. A group of falcons, hooded and tethered to their man-made roosts, sits in the cabin of a private jet. A cheetah (unless it’s a jaguar) lounges in the passenger seat of a black Lamborghini.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/arts/08CHALLENGE1/08CHALLENGE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/08/arts/08CHALLENGE1/08CHALLENGE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/arts/08CHALLENGE1/08CHALLENGE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/arts/08CHALLENGE1/08CHALLENGE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/08/arts/08CHALLENGE1/08CHALLENGE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',