r maximum oomph: a collection modeled by Amazons (Gigi Hadid, Kendall Jenner and Joan Smalls, among them) amply bedazzled but often without pants; Kim Kardashian West and Chaka Khan planted in the front row; and the air thick with the heady scent of Mr. Ford’s new fragrance, called, in a perfect Tom Fordism, “[Expletive] Fabulous.” (The expletive is an amplifying adjective; suffice it to say that Mr. Ford enjoys alliteration.) The fragrance is available in Tom Ford boutiques and at tomford.com.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFORDweb1/07TOMFORDweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/09/fashion/07TOMFO