637, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2295cfac-7e39-5d70-a6cd-de23ee5d46b5'}, {'abstract': 'Police in Houston say more than 20 people remain unaccounted for, and efforts to find them have been complicated by post-storm chaos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/07/us/harvey-storm-missing.html', 'snippet': 'Police in Houston say more than 20 people remain unaccounted for, and efforts to find them have been complicated by post-storm chaos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — They found Jill Renick’s dog, Sweet Pea, at the Omni Houston Hotel. They found her car. But they did not find Ms. Renick until Thursday — 11 days after she went missing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08missing-01/00missing-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'supe