/article/c8a1df0d-26ae-54e1-8741-df79b4f01d49'}, {'abstract': 'In “Little Boxes,” writers share how they were influenced by TV shows, in the days before prestige TV.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/08/books/review/little-boxes-writers-on-influence-of-television-shows.html', 'snippet': 'In “Little Boxes,” writers share how they were influenced by TV shows, in the days before prestige TV.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Little Boxes,” a new collection of essays in which writers appraise the TV shows that influenced them, is for people old enough to remember when “prestige TV” was an oxymoron. People like me, whose first experience with cultural water-cooler talk (water-fountain?), in elementary school, involved the most recent episode of “The A-Team.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/0910-BKS-OpenBook/0910-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 264, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/0910-BKS-OpenBook/0910-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 264}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/0910-BKS-OpenBook/0910-BKS-OpenBook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/0910-BKS-OpenBook/0910-BKS-OpenBook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/10/books/review/0910-BKS-OpenBook/0910-BKS-OpenBook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75