nce Shunned', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Village Prospers With Help of Roma Residents It Once Shunned', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Romani People', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Slovakia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Segregation and Desegregation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rural Areas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mayors', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kotleba, Marian', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bratislava (Slovakia)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Europe', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-09T12:37:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad669b13-d23c-5eb3-ae86-09b5f4a1e0b4', 'word_count': 1275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad669b13-d23c-5eb3-ae86-09b5f4a1e0b4'}, {'abstract': 'Aides said President Trump would receive hurricane briefings throughout the day as the powerful storm marches toward the southern tip of Florida.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/09/us/politics/trump-hurricane-irma-camp-david.html', 'snippet': 'Aides said President Trump would receive hurricane briefings throughout the day as the powerful storm marches toward the southern tip of Florida.', 'lead_paragraph'