ist-residency-science.html', 'snippet': 'Increasingly, they don’t simply reflect modern technology. They play a key role in it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN WE THINK OF ARTIST residencies today, we think of the MacDowell Colony, in the woods of New Hampshire, and of the Skowhegan School, in Maine. There’s the Rome Prize fellowship, at the city’s American Academy, and Donald Judd’s Chinati Foundation, in Marfa. To be an \xadartist in residence means removing yourself from the noise and obligations of regular life, and instead getting to concentrate on your creative life, often in a beautiful locale.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '134', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ/13tmag-stateoftheart-slide-EXYJ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'