+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2da4eb45-907a-59e9-9314-9a8cfdd6400e', 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2da4eb45-907a-59e9-9314-9a8cfdd6400e'}, {'abstract': 'The president and his E.P.A. secretary miss a good opportunity for the nation by ignoring the threat of climate change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/13/opinion/trump-climate-north-korea.html', 'snippet': 'The president and his E.P.A. secretary miss a good opportunity for the nation by ignoring the threat of climate change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'America faces two serious national security threats today that look wildly different but have one core feature in common — they both have a low probability of happening, but, if they did happen, they could have devastating consequences for our whole country and the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/opinion/13friedmanWeb/13friedmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/13/opinion/13friedmanWeb/13friedmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/opinion/13friedmanWeb/13friedmanWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/13/opinion/13friedmanWeb/13friedmanWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'article