r unpaid internships are ever fair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been in and out of therapy for seven years, and I recently had to find a new therapist because of a move. It’s important to find a therapist who is the right fit, so I figured I’d “try out” a few and see whether we meshed or not. Fast-forward a few months: I have been consistently seeing two therapists because I can’t decide on just one.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 886, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 886}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 694, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17ethicist/17ethicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Must I Tell My Therapist About My Other Therapist?', 'kicker': 'The Ethicist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Must I Tell My Therapist About My Other Therapist?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Internships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Therapy and Rehabilitation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Personal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-13T09:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kwame Anthony Appiah', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kwame', 'middlename': 'Anthony', 'lastname': 'Appiah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/763f6cc1-3c1a-5171-90f2-1d66b59b43d1', 'word_count': 1136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/763f6cc1-3c1a-5171-90f2-1d66b59b43d1'}, {'abstract': 'The tennis legend on activism, tobacco sponsorships and the strange experience of watching her own biopic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/13/magazine/billie-jean-king-understands-colin-kaepernick.html', 'snippet': 'The tennis legend on activism, tobacco sponsorships and the strange experience of watching her own biopic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emma Stone plays you in “Battle of the Sexes,” a new film about your 1973 tennis match against Bobby Riggs. You gently corrected her during the promotional tour after she overlooked the racial component in the wage gap. That was very, if you’ll excuse the term, woke of you. How do you keep yourself educated on civil rights issues? I never think I can catch up. Coretta Scott King used to talk about how each generation has to start the fight for freedom over, and I think that’s true, because the pendulum goes back and forth. You ca