'The cheap plastic fasteners are the best tool we have in the fight against chaos, entropy and disorder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/14/magazine/letter-of-recommendation-zip-ties.html', 'snippet': 'The cheap plastic fasteners are the best tool we have in the fight against chaos, entropy and disorder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Successful baby-proofing requires cultivating a morbid imagination. A mother must look past obvious dangers — electrical outlets, toxic cleaning supplies — and see murderous intent in the ostentatiously benign. Bureaus, televisions, window treatments, toilets, doors, lamps, chopsticks, washing machines, stairs, fireplaces, medicine cabinets, spare change, garbage bags — she must physically restrain these objects before they cause her loved ones bodily harm. Complicating this seemingly straightforward task, no two hazards are the same shape, consistency or size.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17mag-lor1/17mag-lor1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17mag-lor1/17mag-lor1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17mag-lor1/17mag-lor1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17mag-lor1/17mag-lor1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/17/magazine/17mag-lor1/17mag-lor1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 