b79-8592-d9b72233fa94', 'word_count': 1076, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3cf6a98-8388-5b79-8592-d9b72233fa94'}, {'abstract': 'Education Secretary Betsy DeVos says she plans to rewrite federal guidelines in an effort to protect both the victims of sexual assault and the accused. Is that a good idea?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/14/learning/how-should-the-problem-of-sexual-assault-on-campuses-be-addressed.html', 'snippet': 'Education Secretary Betsy DeVos says she plans to rewrite federal guidelines in an effort to protect both the victims of sexual assault and the accused. Is that a good idea?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Did you know that in 2011, the Obama administration’s Education Department set forth guidelines for policing sexual assault on college campuses? The guidelines required a tougher response to campus sexual-assault accusations under Title IX of the Education Amendments Act of 1972, which prohibits sex discrimination in education, and they warned colleges that federal funding would be at risk if they did not comply.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08Devos/08Devos-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08Devos/08Devos-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08Devos/08Devos-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08Devos/08Devos-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/08/us/08Devos/08Devos-articleLarg