-14T20:18:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Family', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roni Caryn Rabin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roni', 'middlename': 'Caryn', 'lastname': 'Rabin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/724ea225-d75f-5020-9d49-7e56006a39c1', 'word_count': 1255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/724ea225-d75f-5020-9d49-7e56006a39c1'}, {'abstract': 'We watch the scene at the rollout of the singer’s new cosmetics line, Fenty Beauty, and observe Williams’s extreme grace on the tennis court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/14/podcasts/still-processing-lessons-in-loss-and-power-from-venus-williams-and-rihanna.html', 'snippet': 'We watch the scene at the rollout of the singer’s new cosmetics line, Fenty Beauty, and observe Williams’s extreme grace on the tennis court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, we witnessed two extraordinary events: Venus Williams’s playing some of the best tennis in the last decade of her career (she lost in the semifinals at the U.S. Open, but with style), and the rollout of Rihanna’s new line of cosmetics, Fenty Beauty, which was splashier than the release of the new iPhone X. We learned something unexpected from each. Venus showed us what it means to lose and yet somehow remain undefeated, and the Rhianna event gave us insight into the economy of social media “influencers” who are radically changing — and possibly democratizing — the beauty and fashion industries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/insider/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1/4still-processing-venusandrihanna1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Still Processing: Lessons in Loss and Power from Venus Williams and Rihanna', 'kicker': 'Still Processing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Public Radio', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rihanna', 'rank'