-time enemies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/14/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2017-09-15.html', 'snippet': 'Damon Gulczynski has full-time and part-time enemies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRIDAY PUZZLE — Hi again. California must have been jealous of Florida. We had gale-force winds early Monday and we lost power for most of the day. It’s hard to meet deadlines when everything is dead. Thanks, Sam, for filling in for me while I’m filling in for Deb.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15wordplay-whales-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/15/crosswords/15wordplay-whales/15w