d American influences, with bites like bacon-wrapped dates, an array of sushi rolls, crudos and ceviches, and more substantial Korean-style short ribs and lamb chops. Rum drinks aplenty can fuel lunch or dinner, including a tobacco rum old-fashioned scented with homemade cigar bitters, appropriate enough since the former Tobacco Warehouse (now St. Ann’s Warehouse theater) is next door:  55 Water Street (Main Street), Dumbo, Brooklyn, 718-473-9555, sugarcanerawbargrill.com/Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/20/dining/20OFF1/20OFF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1467, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo'