an and Venezuela as a battle of good versus evil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — President Trump brought the same confrontational style of leadership he has used at home to the world’s most prominent stage on Tuesday as he vowed to “totally destroy North Korea” if it threatened the United States and denounced the nuclear agreement with Iran as “an embarrassment” that he may abandon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Combative Style and Epithets, Trump Takes America First to the U.N.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heralding ‘America First’ In Combative U.N. Speech, Trump Airs List of Threats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Assembly (UN)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-19T17:57:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2d960a0-09d1-5b47-b4d6-f60baf77598d', 'word_count': 1607, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2d960a0-09d1-5b47-b4d6-f60baf77598d'}, {'abstract': 'The police said that the killings may have been racially motivated. The suspect was arrested twice in recent days on unrelated charges but was released.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/19/us/baton-rouge-shooting-killings.html', 'snippet': 'The police said that the killings may have been racially motivated. The suspect was arrested twice in recent days on unrelated charges but was released.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police in Baton Rouge, La., have charged a 23-year-old white man in the separate killings of two black men last week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 792}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 939, 'width': 711, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/us/19xp-batonrouge/19xp-batonrouge-superJumbo