s and, with a long putter, the “yips” to win on the Senior PGA Tour.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/19/sports/golf/charles-owens-dead-pro-golfer-who-devised-long-putter.html', 'snippet': 'Owens overcame segregation, severe injuries and, with a long putter, the “yips” to win on the Senior PGA Tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Charles Owens was going to jump-start a late-blooming golf career, he had to fix his putting. He was 51 and playing on the Senior PGA Tour. He had bad legs and a painful back. And he had the yips — involuntary hand and arm movements that caused him to yank his putts one way or the other.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1026, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1026}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 599, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1198, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/19/arts/18owens-obit-1/18owens-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r