ns to be one of those rare moments when traffic is actually moving, you could fill a bookcase with the stories going on overhead, all endeavoring furiously to be elsewhere. On the B.Q.E., even more than on most highways, success means getting off it. It is a non-place, measured in units of time, not distance. Its existence expresses a builder’s preference — in this case, Robert Moses’s — for automobiles over the communities of people living below.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/24/nyregion/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5/24albumbqe-slide-TAM5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '