a-7625-5dd1-9350-dd8ea9acec3c'}, {'abstract': 'An online campaign hopes to raise awareness about the indiscriminate use of images by influencers and fashion brands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/24/fashion/milan-fashion-week-street-style-photographers.html', 'snippet': 'An online campaign hopes to raise awareness about the indiscriminate use of images by influencers and fashion brands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — They roam in packs. Milling expectantly, cameras in hand, dozens of street-style photographers hover on the sidewalks of fashion week cities in the hope that stylish pedestrians will cross their paths on the way to the front row. When they do — and they always do — pandemonium follows; like a stampede of thirsty wildebeests to the watering hole, the photographers will charge into oncoming traffic or even other guests in their quest for the perfect shots.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/fashion/24PHOTO-web1/24PHOTO-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/24/fashion/24PHOTO-web1/24PHOTO-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/fashion/24PHOTO-web1/24PHOTO-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/fashion/24PHOTO-web1/24PHOTO-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/24/fashion/24PHOTO-web1/24PH