 able to stay in business and evade serious penalties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/24/nyregion/chinatown-buses-violations-queens-crash.html', 'snippet': 'Even after deadly crashes like the one in Queens last week, discount bus companies are often able to stay in business and evade serious penalties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every time a charter bus is involved in a grisly crash like the one that left three people dead in Queens last week, elected officials demand more scrutiny of the thousands of American companies that privately operate buses. But they do not need to look any farther than Chinatown in Manhattan to see how challenging it can be to stop even a serial violator of the rules of the roads.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/23/nyregion/00buses1/00buses1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th