nited States Special Operations forces, deployed across the globe, have grown in power and numbers over four decades. But are they stretched too thin?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/25/us/special-ops-retro.html', 'snippet': 'United States Special Operations forces, deployed across the globe, have grown in power and numbers over four decades. But are they stretched too thin?', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to just about every policy set by Barack Obama, President Trump has proved to be a dedicated Marxist. As in Groucho Marx. In the 1932 film “Horse Feathers,” Marx sang, “Whatever it is, I’m against it.” The same holds for Mr. Trump, who has made dismantling the Obama legacy his goal, one program at a time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Special Ops Forces: How Elite Forces Became Military Muscle', 'kicker': 'Retro Report', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Special Operations Command', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Entebbe (Uganda)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping and Hostages', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden,