0b9a'}, {'abstract': 'The graduation of the first woman from the Marine Corps’ grueling Infantry Officer Course is momentous. Soon, I hope, it will be no big deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/25/opinion/marine-corps-women-.html', 'snippet': 'The graduation of the first woman from the Marine Corps’ grueling Infantry Officer Course is momentous. Soon, I hope, it will be no big deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a rite of passage that I have experienced: brand-new lieutenants introducing themselves to their platoons of a few dozen enlisted Marines. It is a powerful experience for any new officer. Now consider the stakes when that lieutenant is a woman — and the platoon is a front-line infantry unit. The Marine Corps is the most male-dominated of the armed services, and the infantry is the most male-dominated bastion of the corps. The moment will be electric, and historic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/23/opinion/00Fazio/00Fazio-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Thickest Glass Ceiling in the Marine Corps Breaks', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gender', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-25T21:27:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Teresa Fazio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Teresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fazio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e1cda68-1f4e-55f5-9a5b-b1b1d9a6c558', 'word_count': 1130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e1cda68-1f4e-55f5-9a5b-b1b1d9a6c558'}, {'abstract': 'Foreign leaders and immigrant groups here reacted strongly to new restrictions being imposed by President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/25/us/travel-ban-reaction.html', 'snippet': 'Foreign leaders and immigrant groups here reacted strongly to new restrictions being imposed by President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When President Trump announced the latest and most far-reaching version of his travel ban on Sunday, citing threats to national security posed by letting citizens of specific countrie