mes.com/2017/09/27/travel/sustainable-travel-budget-affordable-tips.html', 'snippet': 'Not only should traveling sustainably not break the bank — it’s frequently a more enjoyable product than its nonsustainable counterpart. Some tips on how to make it happen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you think of sustainable travel, what comes to mind? Gorilla trekking in Uganda, perhaps, or a sojourn in a remote yet well-appointed eco-lodge in the forests of Costa Rica, or even a luxurious stay at a Galápagos safari camp with an infinity pool and locally made teak furniture. If these high-cost trips are what pop into your head, your picture of what qualifies as sustainable tourism is not necessarily wrong — it’s just incomplete.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 974}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/travel/01FRUGAL1/01FRUGAL1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 631, 'subTy