s (State)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plea Bargaining', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-27T22:06:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c49a11d2-2efa-5f64-bffd-8e9f22bde386', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c49a11d2-2efa-5f64-bffd-8e9f22bde386'}, {'abstract': 'Moving with a partner — either for the first or the 10th time — has unique challenges. Here’s how to do it right, without risking your relationship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/27/smarter-living/how-to-move-couples.html', 'snippet': 'Moving with a partner — either for the first or the 10th time — has unique challenges. Here’s how to do it right, without risking your relationship.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I’m never moving with you again.” Nick, my then-boyfriend, stood over the shattered remains of his favorite mug, coconut oil pooling at his feet. I gripped the remains of the box that, until the bottom fell out, I swore I’d packed perfectly. We’d spent weeks before the big day bickering over everything, from how to pack our cocktail coupes to whether his Lego collection needed downsizing. By moving day, we were barely speaking.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/27/us/27sl-couplesmoving2/27sl-couplesmoving2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '