 the Distance,” he courted Drew Barrymore. Now in the disjointed “Literally, Right Before Aaron,” Mr. Long romances, or tries to re-romance, Cobie Smulders. Ms. Smulders plays Allison, who went out with Adam (Mr. Long) for years before they broke up. Now she has invited him to her wedding to Aaron (Ryan Hansen), and Adam is ambivalent about it at best, unhinged at worst. He decides to attend and win her back.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/29LITERALLY/merlin-to-scoop-127696322-418433-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/movies/