/28/dining/wine-school-assignment-crozes-hermitage.html', 'snippet': 'In the northern Rhône Valley of France, Crozes-Hermitage can often be an afterthought. But the wines are rapidly improving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Next up will be Crozes-Hermitage from the northern Rhône Valley of France. It was not my first choice or even my second, which I guess is fitting for a wine that is often an afterthought.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 689}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 892, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1783, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/dining/04Next/04Next-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Next Lesson: Crozes-Hermitage', 'kicker