Alabama. But many love his kind of activism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/29/opinion/activist-judge-roy-moore.html', 'snippet': 'Conservatives who hate judicial activism should be alarmed by Roy Moore, the Republican Senate nominee in Alabama. But many love his kind of activism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For some time now conservative Republicans have been screaming about activist judges who put their own political opinions above the law. And they’ve been right to complain. But now, thanks to socially conservative voters in Alabama, we learn that they didn’t really mean it. What bothered them weren’t activist judges in general — but liberal activist judges in particular. Conservative activism by a judge who gets his marching orders from the Bible is apparently fine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1033, 'width': 1383, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/09/29/opinion/29bgoldbergWEB2/29bgoldbergWEB2-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Activist Judge Conservatives Love', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Roy S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALABAMA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-09-29T20:26:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bernard Goldberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bernard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/cba36923-ba2d-5623-b654-312eb76b408b', 'word_count': 628, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cba36923-ba2d-5623-b654-312eb76b408b'}, {'abstract': 'The in-demand Chinese designer brings her fantastical high-fashion to the Peach State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/09/29/t-magazine/fashion/guo-pei-scad-show.html', 'snippet': 'The in-demand Chinese designer brings her fantastical high-fashion to the Peach State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the designer Guo Pei turned 100 days old, her family dressed her in a special outfit made from one of her grandmother’s old silk qipaos in accordance with Chinese tradition. Guo was born during the Cultural Revolution, when citizens w